# Markup+ Complete Test

Welcome to **Markup+** — a modern markup language with `more features` than Markdown.

---

## 1. Text Formatting

This is **bold text**, this is *italic text*, and this is `inline code`.

You can combine: **bold with *italic* inside**.

Special characters: `< > & " '` are safely escaped.

Strikethrough ~~text~~ here.

