## 24. Links Test

- Simple link: [Google](https://google.com)
- Link with title: [Docs](https://docs.example.com "Official Docs")
- Autolink: <https://example.com>
- Combined: [**Bold link**](https://example.com)
- Strikethrough: ~~[Old link](https://old.com)~~

---

## 25. Summary

All features work:

- ✅ Headings (H1-H6)
- ✅ Bold, italic, inline code
- ✅ Strikethrough
- ✅ Paragraphs
- ✅ Unordered and ordered lists
- ✅ Blockquotes
- ✅ Horizontal rules
- ✅ Code blocks with syntax highlighting
- ✅ Copy/download/preview buttons
- ✅ Live preview for HTML/CSS/JS
- ✅ Single images with lightbox
- ✅ Galleries with lightbox
- ✅ Image zoom
- ✅ Image descriptions
- ✅ Tables with alignment
- ✅ Light and dark themes
- ✅ Smooth animations
- ✅ Scroll animations

**Enjoy Markup+!** 🚀